{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31584","headline":"九子坡闻鹧鸪 · 李羣玉","name":"九子坡闻鹧鸪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落照苍茫秋草明，鹧鸪啼处远人行。\n正穿诘曲崎岖路，更听钩輈格磔声。\n曾泊桂江深岸雨，亦于梅岭阻归程。\n此时爲尔肠千断，乞放今宵白发生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}